<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rodman cuts Datum.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rodman cuts Datum.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Rodman &amp; Renshaw said it downgraded Datum Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The stock has reached our target price and we do not see significant additional upside potential in the intermediate term,&quot; a Rodman report said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 2-1/2 to 20-1/4.</p>
</text>
